<section class="section"><div class="container" style="max-width:900px"><div class="section__heading"><div class="eyebrow">HELP</div><h1>{{ section.settings.heading }}</h1><p>Quick answers about shopping, delivery, products and support.</p></div>{% if section.blocks.size > 0 %}{% for block in section.blocks %}<details class="faq-item" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}><summary>{{ block.settings.question }}</summary><div class="rte">{{ block.settings.answer }}</div></details>{% endfor %}{% else %}<details class="faq-item" open><summary>Where can I shop Mogachi Ruch products?</summary><div class="rte"><p>Browse the <a href="/collections/all">All Products</a> collection or start with <a href="/pages/shop">Shop</a>.</p></div></details><details class="faq-item"><summary>How do I choose a product?</summary><div class="rte"><p>Visit the product page for the current ingredients, pack information, variants, price and availability.</p></div></details><details class="faq-item"><summary>How can I track my order?</summary><div class="rte"><p>Use the tracking information sent after dispatch or visit <a href="/pages/track-order">Track Your Order</a>.</p></div></details><details class="faq-item"><summary>What if my order arrives damaged or incorrect?</summary><div class="rte"><p>Contact us promptly with your order number and photographs so the team can review the issue.</p></div></details><details class="faq-item"><summary>Do you offer gifting and bulk orders?</summary><div class="rte"><p>Yes. Visit <a href="/pages/gifts">Gift Collections</a>, <a href="/pages/corporate-gifting">Corporate Gifting</a> or <a href="/pages/wholesale">Wholesale</a>.</p></div></details>{% endif %}</div></section><style>.faq-item{border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding:18px 0}.faq-item:last-child{border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}.faq-item summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:700;font-size:17px}.faq-item .rte{padding-top:12px;opacity:.8}</style>
{% schema %}{"name":"FAQ","max_blocks":12,"settings":[{"type":"text","id":"heading","label":"Heading","default":"Frequently Asked Questions"}],"blocks":[{"type":"faq","name":"Question","settings":[{"type":"text","id":"question","label":"Question","default":"Where can I shop Mogachi Ruch products?"},{"type":"richtext","id":"answer","label":"Answer","default":"<p>Browse our collection online.</p>"}]}],"presets":[{"name":"FAQ"}]}{% endschema %}